OL,5,G1100 Sussex: Jewel of the South Coast
OL,6,     FA Bronze Age settlement is
OL,7,     Funcovered near Hastings; we delve
OL,8,     Finto the revolutionary past of a
OL,9,     FLewes pub; and a paragliding
OL,10,     Finstructor offers a perspective on
OL,11,     FSussex from the sky. (Ep3)
OL,12,G1200 Reuben Owen: Life in the Dales
OL,13,     FReuben tackles a tough quarry rock
OL,14,     Fwith bold methods; it's breeding
OL,15,     Fseason for the flock; there's a
OL,16,     Frisky tree felling job; and
OL,17,     FBonfire Night brings autumn to a
OL,18,     Fclose.
